1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 11=

21
00:01:57,031 --> 00:01:58,270
I remember he sent you a lamp

22
00:01:58,470 --> 00:01:59,830
when I was at your place.

23
00:02:00,311 --> 00:02:01,750
Was it after the hot spring trip?

24
00:02:02,190 --> 00:02:02,671
Right.

25
00:02:03,231 --> 00:02:04,110
I almost forgot.

26
00:02:05,511 --> 00:02:07,270
I thought he had changed his mind,

27
00:02:07,550 --> 00:02:08,871
so I reached out a few times.

28
00:02:09,111 --> 00:02:10,111
He never replied

29
00:02:10,551 --> 00:02:11,670
and kept avoiding me.

30
00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:14,910
Avoiding you?

31
00:02:16,510 --> 00:02:17,790
He gave you a gift,

32
00:02:17,831 --> 00:02:18,910
ignored your messages,

33
00:02:19,591 --> 00:02:20,470
and avoided you.

34
00:02:21,871 --> 00:02:23,111
Why would he do that?

35
00:02:48,111 --> 00:02:48,910
So,

36
00:02:49,510 --> 00:02:50,871
since that lamp arrived,

37
00:02:51,431 --> 00:02:52,950
every conversation between us

38
00:02:53,871 --> 00:02:54,831
was heard by him.

39
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,630
No wonder he was

40
00:02:58,670 --> 00:02:59,551
always one step ahead.

41
00:03:00,151 --> 00:03:01,431
He fed me empty promises,

42
00:03:02,431 --> 00:03:03,591
used me as a pawn,

43
00:03:04,431 --> 00:03:05,630
and tossed me aside.

44
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:06,991
Should we

45
00:03:07,670 --> 00:03:08,910
make our move in response?

46
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:12,391
What's your plan?

47
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,311
Hello, Mom.

48
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:18,111
Meng,

49
00:03:18,551 --> 00:03:19,950
come to the hospital.

50
00:03:20,510 --> 00:03:22,350
Your dad lost his temper.

51
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:24,630
(He said having been
hospitalized so long,)

52
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:25,711
(he can't sleep well.)

53
00:03:26,031 --> 00:03:27,178
(He wants to be discharged.)

54
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,391
(Hurry over. I can't stop him.)

55
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:31,591
Mom,

56
00:03:32,111 --> 00:03:32,750
what's going on?

57
00:03:35,391 --> 00:03:35,910
Don't worry.

58
00:03:36,470 --> 00:03:37,311
Dad is asleep.

59
00:03:38,031 --> 00:03:38,991
Luckily, Ms. Hui's here.

60
00:03:39,431 --> 00:03:39,871
Ms. Hui?

61
00:03:47,991 --> 00:03:48,790
Why is she here?

62
00:03:50,670 --> 00:03:51,711
I came to see Dad earlier,

63
00:03:52,230 --> 00:03:53,470
and left a document.

64
00:03:53,711 --> 00:03:54,311
So I asked

65
00:03:54,311 --> 00:03:55,350
Ms. Hui to pick it up.

66
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,190
She happened

67
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,391
to see Dad losing his temper,

68
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,711
so she stepped in.

69
00:04:01,311 --> 00:04:02,111
What a coincidence!

70
00:04:10,151 --> 00:04:11,311
Yu Meng is onto me now.

71
00:04:12,510 --> 00:04:13,431
She replaced the bed.

72
00:04:13,831 --> 00:04:14,910
Don't be overly alarmed.

73
00:04:15,510 --> 00:04:16,470
She's always been

74
00:04:16,591 --> 00:04:17,470
so unpredictable.

75
00:04:18,151 --> 00:04:19,110
When she replaced it,

76
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:20,031
I wanted you to leave,

77
00:04:20,631 --> 00:04:21,670
but it'd seem suspicious.

78
00:04:22,271 --> 00:04:23,391
Now that her dad needs you,

79
00:04:23,910 --> 00:04:25,071
you have every reason

80
00:04:25,071 --> 00:04:25,591
to leave.

81
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:27,230
Are you afraid

82
00:04:27,230 --> 00:04:28,230
I'd ruin the cozy world

83
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:29,031
between you two?

84
00:04:29,511 --> 00:04:29,990
You hate

85
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:30,790
having me around?

86
00:04:31,391 --> 00:04:32,391
Indeed.

87
00:04:33,631 --> 00:04:35,151
(Because when you're around,)

88
00:04:35,546 --> 00:04:36,790
(I have to play the loving husband)

89
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:37,511
(to Yu Meng.)

90
00:04:38,230 --> 00:04:39,191
(Without you around,)

91
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:40,191
(I'd feel at ease,)

92
00:04:41,230 --> 00:04:42,230
(as I wouldn't need to)

93
00:04:42,230 --> 00:04:42,910
(put on a show.)

94
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:44,430
(I can focus on)

95
00:04:44,470 --> 00:04:45,110
(the company,)

96
00:04:45,951 --> 00:04:47,271
(and get us out of here soon.)

97
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:02,831
Having our person around
is more reassuring.

98
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,751
Luckily, I gave Duan a bonus.

99
00:05:07,191 --> 00:05:08,110
She'll keep an eye.

100
00:05:08,303 --> 00:05:09,391
They don't dare act rashly

101
00:05:09,391 --> 00:05:10,591
in front of your mom

102
00:05:10,591 --> 00:05:11,191
and Duan.

103
00:05:12,631 --> 00:05:13,470
There's something

104
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:14,550
I find rather strange.

105
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:16,071
Lately, Mr. Tian

106
00:05:16,350 --> 00:05:17,550
always visits my dad.

107
00:05:18,191 --> 00:05:19,230
I've seen him for times.

108
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:21,071
Maybe he just wants

109
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:21,951
to cheer your dad up.

110
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,910
I don't know if I'm overthinking it,

111
00:05:28,230 --> 00:05:29,550
but Mr. Tian's face

112
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:30,071
looks tense.

113
00:05:30,670 --> 00:05:31,831
And every time he leaves,

114
00:05:32,071 --> 00:05:32,990
he's always in a rush,

115
00:05:33,591 --> 00:05:34,631
leaving me no chance

116
00:05:34,631 --> 00:05:35,071
to chat.

117
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:36,670
How's your dad been doing?

118
00:05:36,790 --> 00:05:38,031
Is his sleep getting better?

119
00:05:39,990 --> 00:05:41,110
No.

120
00:05:41,670 --> 00:05:42,990
Today, he even chewed Duan out

121
00:05:43,071 --> 00:05:44,350
somehow.

122
00:05:45,031 --> 00:05:45,790
Tell Duan

123
00:05:45,990 --> 00:05:46,951
to try to eavesdrop

124
00:05:47,031 --> 00:05:47,751
on them.

125
00:05:49,711 --> 00:05:50,870
It's quite strange, right?

126
00:05:51,031 --> 00:05:52,071
Your dad's been hospitalized
for so long.

127
00:05:52,071 --> 00:05:53,591
A shareholder visiting frequently

128
00:05:54,151 --> 00:05:55,071
isn't a good sign.

129
00:05:56,071 --> 00:05:56,951
I'll text her now.

130
00:05:59,071 --> 00:06:00,831
Can a lawyer tell someone to eavesdrop?

131
00:06:01,391 --> 00:06:02,470
You can't close your ears.

132
00:06:02,631 --> 00:06:03,550
How can you avoid it?

133
00:06:06,230 --> 00:06:06,591
I...

134
00:06:06,790 --> 00:06:07,631
I have to go.

135
00:06:07,831 --> 00:06:08,550
What?

136
00:06:08,550 --> 00:06:09,990
Going to eavesdrop yourself?

137
00:06:09,990 --> 00:06:10,591
No.

138
00:06:10,631 --> 00:06:12,071
The device for Kang Long arrived.

139
00:06:12,230 --> 00:06:12,951
I'll receive it.

140
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:14,910
Aren't you in charge of marketing?

141
00:06:15,031 --> 00:06:15,751
Why do they dump

142
00:06:15,751 --> 00:06:16,470
everything on you?

143
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,550
We're still short-staffed.

144
00:06:18,670 --> 00:06:19,271
Right now,

145
00:06:19,350 --> 00:06:21,110
I'll just help wherever I can.

146
00:06:21,511 --> 00:06:22,790
You've really changed.

147
00:06:22,990 --> 00:06:24,230
Back then, you slacked off

148
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:25,071
wherever you could.

149
00:06:25,631 --> 00:06:26,310
I'll go with you.

150
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:26,990
Me too.

151
00:06:28,071 --> 00:06:28,550
Let's go.

152
00:06:28,831 --> 00:06:29,350
See you.

153
00:06:30,631 --> 00:06:31,031
Bye.

154
00:06:34,511 --> 00:06:35,430
Finally done.

155
00:06:35,591 --> 00:06:36,870
Meng works so hard.

156
00:06:36,990 --> 00:06:37,591
After this,

157
00:06:37,831 --> 00:06:38,591
she has to go

158
00:06:38,591 --> 00:06:39,631
to take care of Mr. Yu.

159
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,350
Got plans tonight?

160
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:45,711
I have a few questions

161
00:06:45,711 --> 00:06:46,511
for our next shoot,

162
00:06:46,790 --> 00:06:48,031
just us two.

163
00:06:48,751 --> 00:06:50,271
It's after hours.

164
00:06:50,831 --> 00:06:51,870
Do you really hate

165
00:06:51,951 --> 00:06:52,870
being around me?

166
00:06:53,391 --> 00:06:54,550
Well, I'll take my leave.

167
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:55,110
Wait.

168
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:56,951
Dr. Kang,

169
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:58,031
no one wants

170
00:06:58,031 --> 00:06:59,271
to talk about work after hours.

171
00:06:59,271 --> 00:07:00,230
If you need anything,

172
00:07:00,230 --> 00:07:01,470
contact me during work hours.

173
00:07:01,831 --> 00:07:02,271
Bye.

174
00:07:03,951 --> 00:07:04,430
Bye.

175
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:08,670
Zi,

176
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:10,391
is Dr. Kang into you?

177
00:07:11,831 --> 00:07:13,110
Mind your own business.

178
00:07:16,071 --> 00:07:16,631
How's it?

179
00:07:16,910 --> 00:07:18,031
Wonderful.

180
00:07:18,511 --> 00:07:19,670
I didn't expect

181
00:07:19,951 --> 00:07:21,031
that my girl

182
00:07:21,271 --> 00:07:23,151
is getting the hang
of taking care of me.

183
00:07:23,470 --> 00:07:25,350
You're like a pro now.

184
00:07:27,031 --> 00:07:27,470
Dad,

185
00:07:27,951 --> 00:07:29,310
your legs are

186
00:07:29,350 --> 00:07:30,151
so bony.

187
00:07:30,470 --> 00:07:31,631
You've lost so much weight.

188
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,151
Of course.

189
00:07:36,071 --> 00:07:37,191
I got locked up

190
00:07:37,271 --> 00:07:38,670
in here every day.

191
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,350
Good thing Mr. Tian and Mr. Dong

192
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:41,430
visit you often

193
00:07:41,951 --> 00:07:42,790
to cheer you up.

194
00:07:44,110 --> 00:07:44,990
Don't mention them.

195
00:07:45,711 --> 00:07:46,350
I know exactly

196
00:07:46,391 --> 00:07:47,831
what they are after.

197
00:07:50,071 --> 00:07:50,870
What are they after?

198
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,631
I don't want to talk about them.

199
00:07:55,151 --> 00:07:55,670
Meng,

200
00:07:56,990 --> 00:07:58,470
I have something here for you.

201
00:08:00,670 --> 00:08:01,831
Take a look.

202
00:08:03,910 --> 00:08:04,591
This is

203
00:08:05,670 --> 00:08:06,870
an insurance policy

204
00:08:07,151 --> 00:08:09,951
(Life Insurance Policy)
I bought for you when you were born.

205
00:08:10,790 --> 00:08:11,591
The premiums

206
00:08:11,751 --> 00:08:13,031
are completely paid up.

207
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:15,391
When you turn seventy,

208
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,071
you can start collecting it.

209
00:08:17,831 --> 00:08:18,631
Seventy?

210
00:08:20,271 --> 00:08:21,670
Dad, it is so far away.

211
00:08:21,910 --> 00:08:23,031
Even I know it's unworthy.

212
00:08:25,031 --> 00:08:26,430
You've been in the business world

213
00:08:26,470 --> 00:08:27,591
for your whole life,

214
00:08:27,790 --> 00:08:28,591
yet you end up

215
00:08:28,790 --> 00:08:29,751
getting scammed?

216
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:31,951
When you turn seventy,

217
00:08:32,310 --> 00:08:34,271
I won't be around anymore.

218
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:35,391
By then,

219
00:08:35,471 --> 00:08:37,351
you'll be an old lady.

220
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:40,231
By then, if you want to call out

221
00:08:40,391 --> 00:08:42,111
"Dad, I want this,

222
00:08:42,111 --> 00:08:43,550
Dad, I want that,"

223
00:08:44,231 --> 00:08:45,910
I won't be there to give it to you.

224
00:08:46,231 --> 00:08:47,070
By then,

225
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,950
take this money

226
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:51,151
and buy whatever you want,

227
00:08:51,511 --> 00:08:53,351
as a gift from me,

228
00:08:53,391 --> 00:08:53,950
okay?

229
00:08:55,271 --> 00:08:56,351
Stop talking nonsense.

230
00:08:57,111 --> 00:08:58,550
You always say things like this.

231
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:00,351
You and Mom

232
00:09:00,351 --> 00:09:01,430
will always be by my side.

233
00:09:01,790 --> 00:09:03,430
You two will live long.

234
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:04,310
Heard me?

235
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:05,471
Alright.

236
00:09:06,031 --> 00:09:06,991
Alright.

237
00:09:07,111 --> 00:09:08,151
Live long.

238
00:09:08,751 --> 00:09:09,910
(A divorce is a battle.)

239
00:09:10,751 --> 00:09:13,070
(I have to fight it alone.)

240
00:09:14,231 --> 00:09:15,430
(I can't drag them into it.)

241
00:09:15,991 --> 00:09:16,790
Today,

242
00:09:17,271 --> 00:09:18,991
I had a formal talk with Mr. Yu,

243
00:09:19,231 --> 00:09:19,950
but he refused.

244
00:09:20,511 --> 00:09:21,190
He said

245
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,991
his body is still good,

246
00:09:23,310 --> 00:09:25,151
so no need to hand over
the signing authority.

247
00:09:25,471 --> 00:09:26,310
I told him

248
00:09:27,031 --> 00:09:28,391
this is only

249
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:29,231
for temporary.

250
00:09:29,871 --> 00:09:31,391
If he feels unwell one day,

251
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,710
the company

252
00:09:32,950 --> 00:09:34,151
can still handle emergencies.

253
00:09:35,151 --> 00:09:35,670
But

254
00:09:36,271 --> 00:09:37,070
he got mad.

255
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:40,790
When people are sick,

256
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:42,231
they'd be sensitive

257
00:09:42,950 --> 00:09:44,151
and hate to hear these things.

258
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,070
Dad has his pride.

259
00:09:46,511 --> 00:09:47,271
He would never

260
00:09:47,271 --> 00:09:48,190
show weakness.

261
00:09:48,950 --> 00:09:49,910
Mr. Yu isn't

262
00:09:50,031 --> 00:09:51,031
a stubborn man.

263
00:09:51,310 --> 00:09:51,790
Anyway,

264
00:09:51,950 --> 00:09:52,710
talk to him more,

265
00:09:53,190 --> 00:09:54,070
and he'll come around.

266
00:09:54,631 --> 00:09:56,151
You're his son-in-law.

267
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:58,111
He will only delegate

268
00:09:58,111 --> 00:09:59,590
the interim signing authority to you.

269
00:10:00,031 --> 00:10:00,871
If anything happens

270
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,031
before he authorizes you,

271
00:10:04,031 --> 00:10:05,288
at the shareholders' meeting,

272
00:10:05,351 --> 00:10:06,631
I'll stand by your side

273
00:10:06,830 --> 00:10:07,631
and fight for you.

274
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:15,471
What is

275
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,751
"interim signing authority"?

276
00:10:16,790 --> 00:10:17,670
When senior executives

277
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:19,031
cannot perform their duties,

278
00:10:19,031 --> 00:10:20,070
they delegate their signing authority

279
00:10:20,070 --> 00:10:21,550
to a proxy temporarily.

280
00:10:21,991 --> 00:10:22,991
The proxy holds the power

281
00:10:22,991 --> 00:10:23,511
over

282
00:10:23,511 --> 00:10:24,190
major decisions,

283
00:10:24,231 --> 00:10:25,391
like fund transfers,

284
00:10:25,391 --> 00:10:26,231
and contract approvals,

285
00:10:26,231 --> 00:10:27,231
as the executives.

286
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:28,471
Now I know why Di Liren

287
00:10:29,111 --> 00:10:30,271
wanted to send Lu Hui

288
00:10:30,271 --> 00:10:31,151
back to the hospital.

289
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:32,751
And I know why Mr. Tian

290
00:10:33,391 --> 00:10:34,430
keeps visiting

291
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:35,031
my dad.

292
00:10:36,511 --> 00:10:37,070
Di Liren

293
00:10:37,070 --> 00:10:38,430
wants the signing authority.

294
00:10:38,830 --> 00:10:39,471
Your dad agreed?

295
00:10:41,391 --> 00:10:41,991
Not yet.

296
00:10:44,710 --> 00:10:45,511
Did you

297
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:47,271
cry?

298
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:54,471
I have to secure

299
00:10:56,111 --> 00:10:57,058
this signing authority.

300
00:10:57,325 --> 00:10:59,638
(Outpatient)

301
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:24,600
Why are you here?

302
00:11:24,950 --> 00:11:25,710
Here to see you.

303
00:11:27,151 --> 00:11:28,550
You kept avoiding me,

304
00:11:29,070 --> 00:11:30,070
so I had to come to you.

305
00:11:30,351 --> 00:11:30,991
What's up?

306
00:11:31,950 --> 00:11:33,310
You fired me

307
00:11:33,430 --> 00:11:34,631
so suddenly.

308
00:11:35,751 --> 00:11:36,670
You owe me a reason.

309
00:11:38,871 --> 00:11:40,511
Firing you wasn't my decision.

310
00:11:40,871 --> 00:11:41,830
The HR director

311
00:11:41,871 --> 00:11:42,511
decided it.

312
00:11:46,031 --> 00:11:46,910
If you need,

313
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:48,070
I can

314
00:11:48,151 --> 00:11:49,070
get you a better job.

315
00:11:49,631 --> 00:11:50,830
Actually,

316
00:11:51,631 --> 00:11:52,550
I've been thinking

317
00:11:52,590 --> 00:11:53,351
about us.

318
00:11:55,830 --> 00:11:56,430
Time for us

319
00:11:56,430 --> 00:11:57,351
to get further.

320
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:01,590
We agreed from the beginning.

321
00:12:01,991 --> 00:12:02,590
No divorce.

322
00:12:02,631 --> 00:12:03,471
I mean,

323
00:12:06,031 --> 00:12:06,910
let's break up.

324
00:12:09,871 --> 00:12:10,430
I know

325
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:12,950
Yu Meng is keeping

326
00:12:13,310 --> 00:12:14,430
a close eye on you.

327
00:12:14,631 --> 00:12:15,550
I see it all,

328
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:16,550
and feel bad for you.

329
00:12:17,070 --> 00:12:18,550
I know you try your best

330
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,111
to look out for me,

331
00:12:20,351 --> 00:12:21,190
but you're helpless.

332
00:12:21,710 --> 00:12:22,631
So I think

333
00:12:23,190 --> 00:12:23,991
breaking up

334
00:12:24,351 --> 00:12:25,111
is best for us.

335
00:12:31,995 --> 00:12:35,105
(Delete Contact)

336
00:12:37,111 --> 00:12:37,790
Keep it.

337
00:12:39,310 --> 00:12:39,991
If you need help,

338
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,351
just come to me.

339
00:12:52,391 --> 00:12:53,310
Then I wish

340
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:54,710
the best for us.

341
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:28,511
What's wrong?

342
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:29,511
What's that?

343
00:13:30,070 --> 00:13:30,550
Nothing.

344
00:13:40,871 --> 00:13:42,670
That was a brilliant counterattack.

345
00:13:44,070 --> 00:13:44,751
Consider it

346
00:13:44,751 --> 00:13:45,710
my farewell gift to you.

347
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:47,231
To be honest,

348
00:13:47,231 --> 00:13:48,271
when you told me the plan,

349
00:13:48,751 --> 00:13:49,710
I had my doubts.

350
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:51,550
How did you know

351
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:52,670
Di Liren would respond me?

352
00:13:53,231 --> 00:13:53,871
And Lu Hui.

353
00:13:54,950 --> 00:13:55,871
Why did she come over?

354
00:13:56,231 --> 00:13:57,391
Di Liren is possessive.

355
00:13:58,231 --> 00:13:59,351
When one of his women

356
00:13:59,511 --> 00:14:00,511
suddenly leaves him,

357
00:14:00,710 --> 00:14:01,790
he must feel reluctant.

358
00:14:02,070 --> 00:14:03,391
As for Lu Hui,

359
00:14:03,751 --> 00:14:04,511
every time Di Liren

360
00:14:04,631 --> 00:14:05,471
leaves the hospital,

361
00:14:05,991 --> 00:14:07,590
she'd watch him by the window.

362
00:14:09,231 --> 00:14:09,910
You are

363
00:14:09,950 --> 00:14:10,790
such a keen observer.

364
00:14:12,430 --> 00:14:13,190
Hang in there.

365
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:14,391
I know

366
00:14:14,550 --> 00:14:15,111
you will win.

367
00:14:17,151 --> 00:14:18,111
Of course, I'll hang in.

368
00:14:18,511 --> 00:14:19,351
If I don't,

369
00:14:19,471 --> 00:14:20,430
my promise to you

370
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:21,351
would be broken.

371
00:14:23,751 --> 00:14:24,190
And you?

372
00:14:24,751 --> 00:14:25,670
What are your plans?

373
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:27,070
I'll further my studies.

374
00:14:27,511 --> 00:14:28,151
Switch tracks.

375
00:14:30,070 --> 00:14:30,830
I'll obtain an MBA,

376
00:14:31,991 --> 00:14:33,031
getting fame and fortune.

377
00:14:34,830 --> 00:14:35,190
Good.

378
00:14:36,310 --> 00:14:37,231
Then I wish you

379
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:38,351
all the best.

380
00:14:39,070 --> 00:14:39,935
Wait for your return.

381
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:41,310
Thanks.

382
00:14:53,031 --> 00:14:53,910
(Free tonight?)

383
00:14:54,391 --> 00:14:54,910
(Let's talk.)

384
00:14:57,871 --> 00:14:58,351
What is it?

385
00:14:59,590 --> 00:15:00,790
Let's talk in person.

386
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,511
Can't talk over the phone.

387
00:15:03,310 --> 00:15:04,031
I heard

388
00:15:04,310 --> 00:15:05,830
Mr. Tian visits Yu Jianguo frequently.

389
00:15:06,471 --> 00:15:07,310
Every chat they take

390
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,351
lasts an hour or two.

391
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:10,830
Did you hear something?

392
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:13,190
Is it related to

393
00:15:13,751 --> 00:15:15,151
the interim signing authority?

394
00:15:16,710 --> 00:15:17,430
Just come.

395
00:15:17,950 --> 00:15:18,511
Talk later.

396
00:15:22,631 --> 00:15:24,391
It's not about the signing authority.

397
00:15:27,231 --> 00:15:28,751
Then why did you ask me to come?

398
00:15:30,590 --> 00:15:31,511
You smell like

399
00:15:31,550 --> 00:15:32,670
women's perfume.

400
00:15:34,231 --> 00:15:35,031
Yu Meng's, I guess.

401
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:36,631
Why do you make me

402
00:15:36,631 --> 00:15:37,991
take the risk of coming here?

403
00:15:39,550 --> 00:15:40,351
You should

404
00:15:40,430 --> 00:15:41,310
be at the hospital

405
00:15:41,310 --> 00:15:42,631
feeding Yu Jianguo now.

406
00:15:43,271 --> 00:15:44,271
You sneak out like this.

407
00:15:44,351 --> 00:15:45,351
What if he suspects you?

408
00:15:55,471 --> 00:15:56,471
You went to the house?

409
00:15:57,151 --> 00:15:58,271
Why take the passports?

410
00:15:58,631 --> 00:15:59,310
I've bought

411
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:00,511
our tickets for tonight.

412
00:16:01,271 --> 00:16:01,950
Visa on arrival.

413
00:16:02,710 --> 00:16:04,111
Just take our passports to board.

414
00:16:05,111 --> 00:16:05,751
In the trunk,

415
00:16:05,871 --> 00:16:07,190
I packed some light luggage.

416
00:16:07,631 --> 00:16:08,790
If we need anything,

417
00:16:09,391 --> 00:16:10,631
just buy it once we arrive.

418
00:16:11,631 --> 00:16:12,590
Are you insane?

419
00:16:16,991 --> 00:16:17,631
If I let you

420
00:16:17,670 --> 00:16:18,670
stay here any longer,

421
00:16:20,430 --> 00:16:21,391
I'd be insane then.

422
00:16:29,991 --> 00:16:31,271
If you don't leave with me,

423
00:16:34,310 --> 00:16:35,430
you can't go back

424
00:16:35,511 --> 00:16:36,550
playing the model husband.

425
00:16:47,111 --> 00:16:48,190
Ms. Hui went out to eat,

426
00:16:48,231 --> 00:16:49,231
but she hasn't returned.

427
00:16:49,391 --> 00:16:50,710
She didn't answer my call.

428
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:52,271
Alright.

429
00:16:52,590 --> 00:16:53,231
I'll call her.

430
00:16:54,511 --> 00:16:55,991
Go get a bowl of soup for my dad.

431
00:16:56,391 --> 00:16:56,830
Thanks.

432
00:17:06,226 --> 00:17:07,754
(Di Liren)

433
00:17:16,379 --> 00:17:17,800
(Wife)

434
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:25,303
Unlock the door.

435
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:30,751
Don't make me say it again.

436
00:18:19,390 --> 00:18:20,191
Which airport?

437
00:18:29,911 --> 00:18:30,471
Honey?

438
00:18:33,671 --> 00:18:34,390
Honey?

439
00:18:37,231 --> 00:18:37,790
Honey?

440
00:18:49,830 --> 00:18:50,390
Honey?

441
00:18:58,605 --> 00:18:59,652
(Mr. Jiao)

442
00:19:00,991 --> 00:19:01,511
Hello?

443
00:19:02,271 --> 00:19:03,511
They don't answer my call.

444
00:19:04,191 --> 00:19:04,870
I asked my mom.

445
00:19:04,951 --> 00:19:05,951
Lu Hui isn't with her.

446
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:06,751
Calm. Listen up,

447
00:19:06,951 --> 00:19:07,991
check things one by one.

448
00:19:08,431 --> 00:19:09,191
Can you reach those

449
00:19:09,271 --> 00:19:09,951
at the company?

450
00:19:10,031 --> 00:19:11,070
Can they reach Di Liren?

451
00:19:11,162 --> 00:19:12,150
I tried. He's not there.

452
00:19:12,711 --> 00:19:13,830
I had Zhang Tao call him,

453
00:19:13,830 --> 00:19:14,630
but no one answers.

454
00:19:15,630 --> 00:19:16,590
I remember you told me

455
00:19:16,671 --> 00:19:17,390
your peephole

456
00:19:17,431 --> 00:19:18,350
can record videos.

457
00:19:18,390 --> 00:19:18,870
Check it

458
00:19:19,031 --> 00:19:20,070
to see if he came home,

459
00:19:20,070 --> 00:19:20,830
and at what time.

460
00:19:21,271 --> 00:19:21,511
Okay.

461
00:19:33,431 --> 00:19:35,191
He hasn't been back today.

462
00:19:40,550 --> 00:19:41,911
Lu Hui came this afternoon.

463
00:19:43,031 --> 00:19:43,830
Strange.

464
00:19:44,671 --> 00:19:45,310
Wasn't she

465
00:19:45,310 --> 00:19:46,511
at the hospital?

466
00:19:46,951 --> 00:19:47,830
Why did she come here?

467
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:50,150
Check if there's

468
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:50,911
anything missing,

469
00:19:50,991 --> 00:19:51,830
especially Di Liren's

470
00:19:51,911 --> 00:19:52,390
personal

471
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:52,911
belongings.

472
00:20:00,431 --> 00:20:01,070
All here.

473
00:20:02,191 --> 00:20:02,751
And documents?

474
00:20:11,390 --> 00:20:12,524
(Passport)

475
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:16,070
His passport is gone.

476
00:20:16,390 --> 00:20:16,951
Are you sure?

477
00:20:17,310 --> 00:20:18,031
Yes.

478
00:20:18,431 --> 00:20:19,550
It was right here last week.

479
00:20:20,191 --> 00:20:21,150
Are they running away?

480
00:20:32,511 --> 00:20:33,070
Don't panic.

481
00:20:33,191 --> 00:20:34,150
I'm coming over.

482
00:20:35,431 --> 00:20:36,231
I don't think he

483
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:36,911
would leave

484
00:20:36,911 --> 00:20:37,790
in such a hurry.

485
00:20:38,031 --> 00:20:38,630
He would

486
00:20:38,711 --> 00:20:39,471
make a full plan.

487
00:20:40,231 --> 00:20:40,751
Besides,

488
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:41,790
most importantly,

489
00:20:41,870 --> 00:20:42,911
you are still a couple.

490
00:20:42,911 --> 00:20:43,911
(Mr. Jiao)
He has no reason to run.

491
00:20:45,711 --> 00:20:46,711
Does living apart

492
00:20:47,431 --> 00:20:48,031
for two years

493
00:20:48,031 --> 00:20:48,790
grant me divorce?

494
00:20:49,070 --> 00:20:49,870
In theory, yes.

495
00:20:52,110 --> 00:20:52,630
But based on

496
00:20:52,711 --> 00:20:53,630
my view of Di Liren,

497
00:20:53,671 --> 00:20:54,310
he believes

498
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:54,951
Jiali's success

499
00:20:55,031 --> 00:20:56,191
is all due to him.

500
00:20:56,511 --> 00:20:57,671
He holds all the power now.

501
00:20:57,751 --> 00:20:58,431
Won't run away.

502
00:20:58,830 --> 00:21:00,671
What can I do right now?

503
00:21:01,191 --> 00:21:02,310
Check if Lu Hui's documents

504
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:02,830
are missing.

505
00:21:02,991 --> 00:21:03,590
Her documents

506
00:21:03,590 --> 00:21:04,671
should be with my parents.

507
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:06,031
I'll go check now.

508
00:21:06,671 --> 00:21:07,550
Wait, don't hang up.

509
00:21:07,630 --> 00:21:08,231
I'm right here.

510
00:21:21,790 --> 00:21:22,271
Honey,

511
00:21:23,390 --> 00:21:24,231
who are you calling?

512
00:21:26,271 --> 00:21:27,070
What's going on?

513
00:21:28,390 --> 00:21:29,671
I have been calling you.

514
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:31,550
Why don't you answer my calls?

515
00:21:33,191 --> 00:21:34,031
I didn't hear it.

516
00:21:38,911 --> 00:21:39,231
Oh, no.

517
00:21:39,471 --> 00:21:40,431
I forgot my phone.

518
00:21:42,671 --> 00:21:43,550
Where were you?

519
00:21:44,031 --> 00:21:44,630
On the road.

520
00:21:45,031 --> 00:21:45,550
Why?

521
00:21:46,471 --> 00:21:47,070
Stop the car.

522
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:02,590
I didn't book any tickets.

523
00:22:06,830 --> 00:22:07,471
Why did you say

524
00:22:07,630 --> 00:22:08,550
you had to leave today?

525
00:22:11,271 --> 00:22:12,433
In the hospital parking lot,

526
00:22:12,751 --> 00:22:13,870
whose car did you get into?

527
00:22:15,031 --> 00:22:15,711
Who is she?

528
00:22:19,671 --> 00:22:20,991
Wen Xiaoxiao from Accounting.

529
00:22:23,070 --> 00:22:24,870
Ever since you sent that photo,

530
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:26,231
Yu Meng's been digging me up.

531
00:22:28,790 --> 00:22:29,911
Since she wants to do it,

532
00:22:30,951 --> 00:22:31,991
I'll let her.

533
00:22:33,870 --> 00:22:35,110
I want to use Wen Xiaoxiao

534
00:22:35,991 --> 00:22:37,100
to let Yu Meng divorce me.

535
00:22:37,870 --> 00:22:39,310
But she doesn't care at all.

536
00:22:40,590 --> 00:22:41,911
You two went to the hospital?

537
00:22:42,350 --> 00:22:42,870
Yes.

538
00:22:45,150 --> 00:22:46,350
I won't pass up any chance

539
00:22:46,431 --> 00:22:47,830
to provoke Yu Meng.

540
00:22:50,870 --> 00:22:52,150
Don't you get it?

541
00:22:52,550 --> 00:22:53,271
No matter how well

542
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,431
I run this company,

543
00:22:54,991 --> 00:22:56,431
I only get peanuts.

544
00:22:56,711 --> 00:22:57,830
But if Yu Meng divorces me,

545
00:22:58,471 --> 00:22:59,191
I can take

546
00:22:59,191 --> 00:23:00,031
half of her assets.

547
00:23:03,550 --> 00:23:04,550
That luxury apartment,

548
00:23:05,590 --> 00:23:06,431
and those cars

549
00:23:07,671 --> 00:23:09,671
are all hers, not mine.

550
00:23:10,951 --> 00:23:12,630
Infidelity doesn't
impact asset division.

551
00:23:12,951 --> 00:23:13,511
Got it?

552
00:23:17,511 --> 00:23:18,630
I'm living on edge,

553
00:23:18,790 --> 00:23:20,390
drained and exhausted.

554
00:23:20,790 --> 00:23:22,271
Do I still have the energy to cheat?

555
00:23:23,711 --> 00:23:24,911
Where is your trust

556
00:23:24,951 --> 00:23:25,431
in me?

557
00:23:25,830 --> 00:23:26,511
Liren.

558
00:23:27,191 --> 00:23:28,951
I'm just so scared, Liren.

559
00:23:29,751 --> 00:23:30,951
You run a company,

560
00:23:31,511 --> 00:23:32,911
and Yu Jianguo trusts you

561
00:23:32,911 --> 00:23:33,671
and values you.

562
00:23:34,511 --> 00:23:35,711
I often ask myself,

563
00:23:36,471 --> 00:23:37,590
If I were in your position,

564
00:23:38,390 --> 00:23:39,830
would I really give all this up,

565
00:23:40,191 --> 00:23:40,991
leave Yu Meng,

566
00:23:41,150 --> 00:23:42,471
and run away with me?

567
00:23:42,911 --> 00:23:43,951
Yu Meng and I seem to

568
00:23:44,031 --> 00:23:44,991
keep the peace,

569
00:23:46,471 --> 00:23:47,390
but we're one step away

570
00:23:47,390 --> 00:23:48,991
from falling out.

571
00:23:50,671 --> 00:23:51,991
She wants to corner me

572
00:23:52,671 --> 00:23:53,870
and destroy my reputation.

573
00:23:54,671 --> 00:23:55,991
Do you think I still feel a thing

574
00:23:56,350 --> 00:23:58,110
for the Yu family or for Yu Meng?

575
00:23:58,991 --> 00:23:59,830
I'm scared.

576
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:03,471
You two once were so close.

577
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:06,231
I'm afraid that you'd soften up.

578
00:24:08,110 --> 00:24:09,231
That's human nature.

579
00:24:15,431 --> 00:24:17,150
We lost that a long time ago.

580
00:24:18,150 --> 00:24:19,550
I often feel like

581
00:24:20,390 --> 00:24:22,350
a disgusting parasite.

582
00:24:26,951 --> 00:24:27,711
But luckily,

583
00:24:31,431 --> 00:24:33,150
whenever I look back,
you're always there.

584
00:24:33,951 --> 00:24:35,630
Even if I'm a parasite,

585
00:24:38,271 --> 00:24:39,271
at least I have you,

586
00:24:40,671 --> 00:24:41,511
and a home.

587
00:24:42,191 --> 00:24:44,031
My life isn't rotten to the core.

588
00:24:47,951 --> 00:24:49,590
If you really can't take it anymore,

589
00:24:50,231 --> 00:24:51,310
I'll abandon all of this.

590
00:24:53,031 --> 00:24:54,590
Because I promised you

591
00:24:55,431 --> 00:24:56,550
once the time is right,

592
00:24:57,630 --> 00:24:58,511
I'll leave with you.

593
00:25:00,711 --> 00:25:01,511
Just do as I say.

594
00:25:02,511 --> 00:25:03,630
Don't act rashly again.

595
00:25:03,991 --> 00:25:05,031
I've sold the gallery.

596
00:25:06,191 --> 00:25:06,911
We just need

597
00:25:06,991 --> 00:25:07,711
one last step.

598
00:25:08,751 --> 00:25:09,110
Okay.

599
00:25:10,471 --> 00:25:10,951
Then,

600
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:12,310
