797
00:33:14,550 --> 00:33:15,590
Meng is so nice.

798
00:33:16,191 --> 00:33:17,431
She's gorgeous, kind,

799
00:33:17,911 --> 00:33:18,511
and capable.

800
00:33:18,951 --> 00:33:19,310
Right.

801
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:20,630
Why didn't you

802
00:33:20,630 --> 00:33:21,751
