873
00:35:11,391 --> 00:35:12,150
However,

874
00:35:12,431 --> 00:35:13,951
there's no one better qualified

875
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:15,511
than Liren now.

876
00:35:19,351 --> 00:35:20,150
I could

877
00:35:20,150 --> 00:35:20,871
