889
00:35:51,511 --> 00:35:52,670
designating the one to get

890
00:35:52,710 --> 00:35:53,639
the signing authority,

891
00:35:53,791 --> 00:35:54,590
then you won't need

892
00:35:54,630 --> 00:35:55,391
